[
  {
    "turn": 1,
    "text": "我已经咳嗽了3到4年了，最近3个月特别严重，几乎整天都在咳。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-01.mp3",
    "duration": 7.04,
    "sha256": "9205c674a19cbf3e8092072ea187be3ac4a87331b2653d527a1f916d24e28a03",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 2,
    "text": "我开始咳嗽时是在散步的时候，走多了就咳嗽，没什么明显诱因。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-02.mp3",
    "duration": 5.52,
    "sha256": "2883e83c05d8590c35d7dc14b6f1b2815a2ee4e22e6b50c8c5317b898c301f44",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 3,
    "text": "这3个月我会咳出白色或透明的痰，不过没有痰里带血的情况。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-03.mp3",
    "duration": 5.6,
    "sha256": "a0863b3e2611de6f01b1dc67daf2172c07f13ef1619a12dd97132e72fbcec2f3",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 4,
    "text": "没有特殊气味。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-04.mp3",
    "duration": 1.12,
    "sha256": "4abb1a9f5af9d0d01f0f87dd44298ae8acafae50b80aaaa5e90a5f4ae8558a1d",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 5,
    "text": "每次不多，但总觉得咳不完。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-05.mp3",
    "duration": 2.88,
    "sha256": "ddc4d13b7aa189fd7206171421924ff4585947c260aa57aecd0da0ddad32b7b3",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 6,
    "text": "咳嗽的时候会有呼吸困难的感觉，没有胸痛、发烧或者怕冷。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-06.mp3",
    "duration": 5.92,
    "sha256": "ae204a0d77c43ec3639b4fb36643a6edf18b743cc70d2f3a91d171a421cfe57c",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 7,
    "text": "活动后会更严重，现在即使在平地上走路也会发作。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-07.mp3",
    "duration": 4.24,
    "sha256": "ae684ec2d2eada500be46bdda873c8209540411d552f5de5ccbeb0aa8bb20c8b",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 8,
    "text": "我过去每天抽半包烟，持续了20年，但在40多岁时就戒烟了。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-08.mp3",
    "duration": 5.92,
    "sha256": "2afab0e3f5857a249c3d283c36afbc7a3958528c9ac697a2e7ca5421fa1efb1d",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 9,
    "text": "没有觉得嗓子干、痒，也没有反酸、烧心或者胸骨后不舒服的情况。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-09.mp3",
    "duration": 6.08,
    "sha256": "d757fc6beba4bd83ea43356f3b271b4f197cc0d760b7a260fe7960de3ed08262",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 10,
    "text": "我有冠心病、高血压、高血脂、糖尿病、慢性肾病，之前做过心梗的介入手术，现在长期吃阿司匹林、氨氯地平、赖诺普利、美托洛尔、阿托伐他汀和二甲双胍。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-10.mp3",
    "duration": 14.88,
    "sha256": "ccf215bcb26758eb809471771eca148259c344f8aab4570008da757e8ae77b5f",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 11,
    "text": "这2年没去复诊过，一直按医生要求吃药，没调整过药物剂量。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-11.mp3",
    "duration": 5.68,
    "sha256": "e1191a7f4da7cd8a0d89d89cd00db8893d14e5f5cb0f61f10c3d5eba6a682d5f",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 12,
    "text": "没有心跳加快或心慌。不过，我有脚踝肿胀，咳嗽的时候晚上躺下会更严重，需要坐起来才能稍微好一点。我还有膝盖疼和背痛，这些对我的日常生活影响很大。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-12.mp3",
    "duration": 14.56,
    "sha256": "62b8eb4e1e2f3c460ca77de6f7971bd3095d749c241f0ac742d886baaa5bd0d1",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 13,
    "text": "医生，我到底怎么了，是不是很严重？",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-13.mp3",
    "duration": 3.68,
    "sha256": "bc2990d74cb2b3675f73eb720b0c5c1456a08c1c64763bb59cabd2c43f65f17c",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 14,
    "text": "好的，谢谢医生。我会配合检查。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-14.mp3",
    "duration": 2.72,
    "sha256": "14480caa4ed48cdf6fd737df491ddba77050333402009d6bfc633d6e98e71736",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 15,
    "text": "家族里有癌症、心脏病、高血压、糖尿病和类风湿性关节炎。我妹妹有类风湿关节炎。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-15.mp3",
    "duration": 8.32,
    "sha256": "f17306eaa3ce6a749980f45575665e5cd98b5c10d7027d732ce30ce65d0a842f",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 16,
    "text": "我已经结婚35年了。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-16.mp3",
    "duration": 1.92,
    "sha256": "93e61b94c87c8ac1e094d0844d4db54a20d35509f750ddeee8e4134358f0654f",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 17,
    "text": "我是女性，没有妻子，我和丈夫一起生活。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-17.mp3",
    "duration": 4.48,
    "sha256": "cf219f74dca6caff599d5469ddaa89ca5c966d163b9f54ad80adb2d4c4c7e3da",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 18,
    "text": "他身体还不错，没有特别严重的健康问题。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-18.mp3",
    "duration": 3.76,
    "sha256": "6ed1f022cd542db34728fd32ed0dcbcea54b01dc15ef27371634e94be1ce1669",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base",
    "voice": "Guoman-mature-synthetic-v1",
    "referenceSha256": "5a5efcdcdb61055c4ddf57d3c3bff5dce297b263fcc02feb9bcc3245ae19d4a7"
  },
  {
    "turn": 19,
    "text": "有，我有三个成年子女。",
    "src": "/assets/patient-audio/turn-19.mp3",
